Z||000000||stingant0||12-25-2001||07:18 PM||||My brother bought a Beretta with a blown head gasket. It only had 60k on a new engine ( the guy was really stupid) My brother replaced the rings and the gaskets. About a month later the engine mount broke lose. Well my bro fixed that by tapping it. It broke again. He retapped it and put a bigger bolt. It broke again!! Finally after the 5th time!!! We found the problem..but to late the hole was unrepairable. The IDIOT who did the engine swap didn't put the cradle bolts in all the way!!!! The engine was twisting and pulling the bolts right out!!! Now we are finishing up the NEW mount we made with 2 angle irons...have to show you guys the pics. Hope we get this out soon so i can rebuild and get the 88 formula running.||||reg||1
